{"a":[19,20],"h":"<p>Bütün bunlara kasem olsun ki 19.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"53\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 53.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 30.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 36.7\" y=\"20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o - olcak dehşetli vukuatı haber veren bu Kur'an<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"157\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 156.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 25.6 32.3 32.3 39.7 60.0 60.0 70.6 78.7 90.0 107.3 107.3 117.7 117.7 126.0 132.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.7 78.7 90.0 126.0 132.7 140.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> şübhesiz bir kerîm Resulün, ya'ni Allah tealâ ındinde mükerrem, muazzez bir Resulün getirdiği kelâmdır. - Sûrei Hâkkada dahi zikri geçtiği üzere burada bu Resuli kerîmden murad, Kur'anı Peygambere getiren ruhı emîn Cebrail aleyhisselâmdır. « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"230\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 229.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 9.7 9.7 9.7 16.6 24.0 39.7 39.7 50.3 50.3 57.7 57.7 64.6 64.6 80.3 96.7 96.7 103.6 103.6 110.3 126.0 137.3 137.3 144.0 162.0 162.0 168.7 176.3 176.3 183.7 199.6 199.6 206.3 206.3 213.0 213.0 219.7\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"80.3 110.3 144.0 168.7 176.3 183.7 206.3 219.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » 20.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"84\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 84.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 31.4 31.4 47.2 60.7 60.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 68.2\" y=\"20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> pek kuvvetli - hâmil olduğu risaleti, me'mur bulunduğu emri iyfada za'fı yok, mukavemet olunmaz, şübhe götürmez, büyük bir kuvveti var, şiddetli bir Resul. Öyle ki «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"149\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 148.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 3.0 9.7 9.7 17.3 17.3 33.0 41.3 41.3 57.7 57.7 71.3 71.3 79.4 79.4 86.3 86.3 93.7 109.4 109.4 118.4 125.3 125.3 134.3\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 134.3\" y=\"20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » Sûrei Necme bak. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"140\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 140.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 31.6 31.6 39.0 45.7 45.7 53.3 69.0 82.6 82.6 99.0 108.0 108.0 114.7 114.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 99.0 123.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Arşın sahibi olan ve onu gönderen Allahi zül'celâl ındinde <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"69\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 68.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 45.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"45.7 52.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> mekîn - mekânetli, ya'ni büyük bir şeref ve hasyiyyeti hâiz, öyle ki 21. </p>"}